WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.513
Sabrina, you look stunning.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.000
I mean seriously, I'm stunned.

00:00:05.861 --> 00:00:10.861
♪ Ooh she's sitting with you
but her eyes are on the door ♪

00:00:10.974 --> 00:00:14.560
♪ Strange magic ♪

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.783
I didn't have a costume, but is this okay?

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:19.953
You're

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.299
beautiful.

00:00:22.299 --> 00:00:24.552
♪ Watching and waiting ♪

00:00:24.552 --> 00:00:28.160
♪ Ooh she's sitting with
you but her eyes are on ♪

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.930
Welcome to Baxter High.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.820
Not quite as magical as the academy.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:34.653
Are you kidding?

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:36.783
Being here with you,

00:00:36.783 --> 00:00:41.180
getting to see this other
side of you, it's...

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.530
It's more magical than
anything at the academy.

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.360
May I have this dance, m'lady?

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:50.321
You most certainly may.

00:00:50.321 --> 00:00:54.197
♪ Here she comes ♪

00:00:54.197 --> 00:00:57.109
(slow rock music)

00:00:57.109 --> 00:00:59.359
Hey, what'd you wish for?

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:06.520
More of this.

00:01:09.858 --> 00:01:11.184
♪ Nothing is new ♪

00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:14.984
♪ I've seen her here before ♪

00:01:14.984 --> 00:01:17.359
♪ Watching and waiting ♪

00:01:17.359 --> 00:01:22.359
♪ Ooh she's sitting with you
but her eyes are on the door ♪

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.093
I love you, Sabrina.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.400
I always have

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:28.580
and I always will.

00:01:29.959 --> 00:01:32.780
(slow rock music)

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.730
Wanna see the rest of the school?

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:36.300
Are you asking me to sneak off with you

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:37.550
and go somewhere private?

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.563
Lead the way, Spellman.

00:01:44.857 --> 00:01:46.850
They're coming to get you, Barbara.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:48.740
Harvey Kinkle, the only person

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:53.740
you're gonna scare is
yourself! (screaming)

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:55.601
Gotcha.

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:59.101
(orchestral music swells)

00:02:00.675 --> 00:02:02.270
Now what?

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:04.920
We lay side by side

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:05.920
soaking up the moon.

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:08.363
Hmmm

00:02:08.363 --> 00:02:11.696
(twinkling piano music)

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.323
How long do we do this for?

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:17.243
All night long

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:19.273
till dawn.

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:22.343
Sounds amazing.

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:28.683
Harvey.

00:02:30.249 --> 00:02:33.749
(serene orchestral music)

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:42.850
I love you, Sabrina.

00:02:44.658 --> 00:02:47.058
I was gonna wait until
your birthday to say that

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.088
but since we maybe can't
celebrate together this year, I--

00:02:51.088 --> 00:02:54.540
I'm glad you didn't.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.680
I love it and you.

00:02:57.733 --> 00:03:01.233
(serene orchestral music)

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.630
Why do you lie so far away from me?

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:10.523
Come closer.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.933
I will not lie beneath you,

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.723
but only by your side.

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:21.527
Is that what you said
to your husband Adam?

00:03:21.527 --> 00:03:23.440
Aren't you cold, woman?

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:26.663
Yes, I've been cold since the garden.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:29.860
Come closer, then

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:32.983
and I'll keep you warm.

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:37.877
(orchestral music swells)

00:03:37.877 --> 00:03:39.535
Harvey.

00:03:39.535 --> 00:03:40.368
Sabrina.

00:03:43.873 --> 00:03:46.365
♪ Treat me bad because I crave you ♪

00:03:46.365 --> 00:03:49.321
♪ I can't fight back but I can take it ♪

00:03:49.321 --> 00:03:52.745
♪ Treat me bad baby I'm prayin' ♪

00:03:52.745 --> 00:03:54.699
♪ You hold my heart ♪

00:03:54.699 --> 00:03:56.070
I missed you so much, Harvey.

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:58.113
I missed you too, Sabrina.

00:03:59.678 --> 00:04:02.568
♪ Won't you hold my heart ♪

00:04:02.568 --> 00:04:06.319
♪ Won't you hold my heart ♪

00:04:06.319 --> 00:04:09.652
(slow orchestral music)

00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:21.716
(twinkling orchestral music)

00:04:41.807 --> 00:04:43.007
Before you keep looking.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.838
♪ You're slipping ♪

00:04:49.838 --> 00:04:53.700
♪ Under a spell ♪

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:58.700
♪ Live in your head and
smile at the devil ♪

00:05:01.037 --> 00:05:02.500
I'm here for you, 'Brina.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:03.633
Always, you know that.

00:05:04.925 --> 00:05:05.758
I do.

00:05:06.662 --> 00:05:07.495
I so do.

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:14.013
You're pretty special, Spellman.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.050
I don't wanna mess things up with you.

00:05:22.075 --> 00:05:25.825
(foreboding orchestra music)

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:33.263
There's no flying in my life

00:05:33.263 --> 00:05:36.363
without you, Sabrina Spellman.

00:05:36.363 --> 00:05:39.780
(orchestra music swells)

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:45.170
I'm here now

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.140
for whatever you need.

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:50.523
This is uncharted territory, Nick.

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.020
Do you think you can handle it?

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:57.820
What are warlock boyfriends for?

00:05:58.963 --> 00:06:02.713
(twinkling orchestral music)

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:08.920
You're always there to catch me.

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:15.730
Will you get everyone out here

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:19.270
and be the one to catch me if I fall?

00:06:20.276 --> 00:06:23.430
I will.

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:24.650
I love you, Harvey.

00:06:29.519 --> 00:06:31.269
I'll always love you.

00:06:32.714 --> 00:06:36.626
(cheering in background)

00:06:36.626 --> 00:06:39.570
Nick, I'm about to step off a cliff

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:41.620
into the great unknown

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:45.700
and you're the one by my side,

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:47.723
holding my hand.

00:06:48.938 --> 00:06:52.688
(twinkling orchestral music)

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.150
I love you too much to risk

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:57.763
anything bad happening to you.

00:06:59.162 --> 00:07:02.579
(tense orchestral music)

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:06.960
I sat with you at lunch because of

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:08.713
the way you sang in choir class.

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:11.573
Do you remember that?

00:07:13.875 --> 00:07:15.292
You were fearless

00:07:17.527 --> 00:07:18.903
and I fell hard.

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:23.553
Can I...

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.040
Can I get one last kiss?

00:07:29.487 --> 00:07:33.154
(foreboding operatic music)

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.310
I'm the best binder and
conjurer since Edward Spellman.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.270
If anyone can keep him trapped, it's me.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.670
Do it, Mr. Scratch.

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:49.503
Nick, Nick!

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:52.960
I love you, Spellman.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.940
You taught me how to love.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:01.760
Will you stay with me?

00:08:04.414 --> 00:08:06.503
All night long.

00:08:06.503 --> 00:08:09.420
(soft piano music)

